{"type":"fact","doc_id":"d3_react_react-compiler-beta-release","statement":"React Compiler officially supports apps on React 17+ through an optional react-compiler-runtime package.","source_span":"officially supporting React Compiler for apps on React 17+, through an optional `react-compiler-runtime` package"}
