{"type":"fact","doc_id":"d3_react_react-compiler-beta-release","statement":"React Compiler Beta and its ESLint plugin are installed via npm with 'npm install -D babel-plugin-react-compiler@beta eslint-plugin-react-compiler@beta'.","source_span":"npm install -D babel-plugin-react-compiler@beta eslint-plugin-react-compiler@beta"}
{"type":"fact","doc_id":"d3_react_react-compiler-beta-release","statement":"By the time of the Beta release, Meta had deployed React Compiler across several major web apps including Facebook and Threads, beyond the earlier Quest Store and Instagram rollout.","source_span":"we've deployed React Compiler across several more major web apps at Meta, including [Facebook] and [Threads]"}
