{"type":"seed","doc_id":"d3_react_react-compiler-beta-release","fact_refs":[0],"question":"Who wrote the React Compiler Beta Release announcement and when was it published?","answer":"Lauren Tan wrote it, published October 21, 2024."}
{"type":"seed","doc_id":"d3_react_react-compiler-beta-release","fact_refs":[1],"question":"What does React Compiler do?","answer":"React Compiler is a build-time tool that optimizes React apps through automatic memoization."}
{"type":"seed","doc_id":"d3_react_react-compiler-beta-release","fact_refs":[2],"question":"Which React versions does React Compiler officially support, and what package enables older versions?","answer":"React Compiler officially supports React 17 and up, using the optional react-compiler-runtime package for versions before React 19."}
{"type":"seed","doc_id":"d3_react_react-compiler-beta-release","fact_refs":[4],"question":"What npm command installs React Compiler Beta along with its ESLint plugin?","answer":"npm install -D babel-plugin-react-compiler@beta eslint-plugin-react-compiler@beta"}
