{"type":"fact","doc_id":"d3_react_react-19","statement":"In React 19, <form> elements support passing functions to the action and formAction props, which use Actions by default and reset the form automatically after submission.","source_span":"`<form>` elements now support passing functions to the `action` and `formAction` props. Passing functions to the `action` props use Actions by default and reset the form automatically after submission"}
